# Generated HTML dashboards are ~3 MB of identical JS each; rebuild one with
#   C:\tools\apache-jmeter-5.6.3\bin\jmeter.bat -g <scenario>/results.jtl -o <scenario>/report
# Raw results, per-run statistics.json, console summaries and sla-summary.md are kept.
*/report/*
!*/report/statistics.json
*/jmeter.log
